### Subasta — activar
POST {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/subastas-tcg/{{crearSubasta.response.body.id}}/activar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}

### Subasta — registrar puja
POST {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/subastas-tcg/{{crearSubasta.response.body.id}}/pujas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}
