### S3g — config Izipay (ShopId + HMAC cifrado; JWT)
PUT {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pagos/izipay/config
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopId": "12345678",
  "hmacSha256Clave": "test-hmac-sha256-key-izipay",
  "activa": true
}

### S3g — IPN Izipay (PAID, sin JWT; tenant en la ruta; form-urlencoded Lyra)
# Sustituir kr-hash por HMAC-SHA256(kr-answer, hmacSha256Clave) en hex.
POST {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pagos/izipay/ipn/{{empresaId}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

kr-hash-algorithm=sha256&kr-hash=REEMPLAZAR_HMAC_HEX&kr-answer={"shopId":"12345678","orderStatus":"PAID","orderDetails":{"orderTotalAmount":15000},"transactions":[{"uuid":"IZP-S3-99821","status":"PAID","amount":15000,"paymentMethodType":"YAPE"}]}

### S3g — asociar transferencia huérfana (después del IPN, listar NOTIFICADO)
GET {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pagos?estado=NOTIFICADO
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}

