### S4g — reportes: kardex, ventas por sede, margen de aperturas
GET {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reportes/kardex-resumen?sedeId={{sedeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}

GET {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reportes/ventas-por-sede
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}

GET {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reportes/aperturas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}

### ========== Sprint 7 — Cierre de caja y arqueo diario ==========

### S7a — estado del turno (POS: si abierta=false no se confirman ventas)
GET {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/caja/sesion-actual?sedeId={{sedeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}

### S7a — resumen actual desglosado por medio de pago y tipo de documento
GET {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/caja/resumen-actual?sedeId={{sedeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}

### S7b — ingreso / egreso de caja chica
POST {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/caja/movimientos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sedeId": "{{sedeId}}",
  "tipo": "INGRESO",
  "monto": 20.00,
  "concepto": "Cambio extra para el turno"
}

POST {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/caja/movimientos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sedeId": "{{sedeId}}",
  "tipo": "EGRESO",
  "monto": 8.50,
  "concepto": "Taxi courier Olva"
}

### S7b — historial de turnos
GET {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/caja?sedeId={{sedeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}

### S7c — cierre con conteo físico (diferencia = real − teórico)
# @name cierreCajaS7
POST {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/caja/cierre
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sedeId": "{{sedeId}}",
  "montoEfectivoReal": 251.40,
  "observacion": "Arqueo de cierre de turno"
}

### S7c — ticket 80mm del arqueo
GET {{CapitalPos.Tcg.Api_HostAddress}}/api/caja/{{cierreCajaS7.response.body.cajaSesionId}}/reporte-ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CapitalPos-EmpresaId: {{empresaId}}

